    "title": "Tampa General Hospital symposium aimed at combatting human trafficking - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Blake DeVine ,\n1 hours ago TAMPA, Fla. - As part of National Human Trafficking Prevention Month, Tampa General Hospital hosted a symposium on Wednesday afternoon. The event was open to the public and focused on education and awareness, with health care workers, law enforcement, advocates and survivors gathered in the Valdes Auditorium. Karley Wright, a registered nurse at TGH who helped organize the hospital’s human trafficking task force, said Tampa's geography and tourism industry make the region vulnerable. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
